// Two Go modules, one workspace: the engine and the app that hosts it.
//
// `packages/core-go` is the analysis engine, importable on its own so the CLI
// and the MCP server can link it without going through the desktop app.
// `desktop` is the Wails application. The workspace lets the app import the
// engine during the migration without a replace directive in its go.mod.
go 1.25.0

use (
	./desktop
	./packages/core-go
)
